1
00:00:01,587 --> 00:00:04,427
Administrator: REALLY?
THIS IS STARTING TO ANNOY ME.

2
00:00:04,427 --> 00:00:06,347
WHY DO YOU INSIST ON STRUGGLING

3
00:00:06,347 --> 00:00:08,307
WHEN THERE IS
NOTHING TO GAIN FROM IT?

4
00:00:08,307 --> 00:00:11,557
IT SHOULD BE OBVIOUS BY NOW
THAT YOU HAVE LOST.

5
00:00:11,557 --> 00:00:14,687
WHY DO YOU CHOOSE TO RESIST
WHEN THE OUTCOME IS CLEAR?

6
00:00:14,687 --> 00:00:17,437
YOUR ACTIONS ARE MEANINGLESS.

7
00:00:17,437 --> 00:00:20,317
Kirito: WHETHER WE CHOOSE
TO DIE ON OUR KNEES

8
00:00:20,317 --> 00:00:23,527
OR WITH A SWORD IN OUR HAND,
IT’S OUR ACTIONS THAT COUNT.

9
00:00:23,527 --> 00:00:25,777
THAT’S WHAT BEIN’ HUMAN’S ABOUT.

10
00:00:27,407 --> 00:00:28,117
( Administrator sighs )

11
00:00:33,867 --> 00:00:38,747
YOU PREFER BLACK, LIKE A KNIGHT
FROM THE DARK TERRITORY.

12
00:00:38,747 --> 00:00:42,167
WELL, BOY, IF YOU WISH
TO CONTINUE SUFFERING SO,

13
00:00:42,167 --> 00:00:44,797
THEN I SHALL MAKE YOURS
VERY LONG AND CRUEL,

14
00:00:44,797 --> 00:00:47,007
BEYOND ANYTHING YOU CAN IMAGINE.

15
00:00:47,007 --> 00:00:50,757
YOU’LL BE IN SUCH MISERY,
YOU’LL BE BEGGING ME FOR DEATH.

16
00:00:50,757 --> 00:00:53,017
Kirito: THAT WON’T BE ENOUGH...

17
00:00:54,597 --> 00:00:57,057
TO MAKE UP FOR MY STUPIDITY.

18
00:00:57,057 --> 00:00:58,437
( singing in Japanese )

19
00:00:58,437 --> 00:01:01,187
♪

20
00:01:29,677 --> 00:01:31,967
♪ PROUD OF MYSELF ♪

21
00:01:39,227 --> 00:01:41,147
♪

22
00:02:33,687 --> 00:02:36,407
Kirito: THE HIGH NORKIA STYLE.

23
00:02:36,407 --> 00:02:39,947
SHE’S GONNA TRY
AND KILL ME WITH ONE STRIKE.

24
00:02:41,327 --> 00:02:42,157
( Administrator chuckles )

25
00:02:45,367 --> 00:02:46,167
( yells )

26
00:02:47,787 --> 00:02:49,417
( Kirito yells )

27
00:02:53,167 --> 00:02:54,587
( Administrator laughs )

28
00:02:54,587 --> 00:02:56,217
( Kirito yells )

29
00:03:01,507 --> 00:03:05,137
Administrator: YES, A ONE-HANDED
FOUR-HIT SWORD SKILL.

30
00:03:05,137 --> 00:03:08,097
IT’S CALLED VERTICAL SQUARE,
IS IT NOT?

31
00:03:08,097 --> 00:03:11,607
Kirito: "SWORD SKILL"?
HOW’S SHE KNOW THAT TERM?

32
00:03:11,607 --> 00:03:14,817
MAYBE SHE GOT IT
FROM EUGEO’S MEMORIES.

33
00:03:14,817 --> 00:03:18,067
ALL RIGHT. I’LL USE
SOMETHING I NEVER SHOWED HIM,

34
00:03:18,067 --> 00:03:20,567
A COMBO WITH MORE
THAN FOUR HITS.

35
00:03:22,327 --> 00:03:23,537
♪

36
00:03:23,537 --> 00:03:24,907
( yells )

37
00:03:27,707 --> 00:03:29,327
- ( gasps )
- ( Administrator grunts )

38
00:03:33,497 --> 00:03:35,547
( giggles )

39
00:03:35,547 --> 00:03:39,547
MINE WAS A SIX-HIT SKILL
CALLED CRUCIFIXION.

40
00:03:39,547 --> 00:03:41,427
( Kirito gasps )

41
00:03:41,427 --> 00:03:42,387
NO WAY.

42
00:03:49,897 --> 00:03:51,557
( yells )

43
00:03:53,227 --> 00:03:54,647
( Administrator grunts )

44
00:03:54,647 --> 00:03:56,237
( Kirito gags )

45
00:03:56,237 --> 00:03:59,107
Administrator:
A ONE-HIT SKILL, ZEKKUU.

46
00:04:02,567 --> 00:04:04,537
THERE IS NOTHING I DO NOT KNOW

47
00:04:04,537 --> 00:04:07,537
ABOUT THE SYSTEM WHICH DRIVES
THE PROPERTIES OF THIS WORLD.

48
00:04:07,537 --> 00:04:08,867
Kirito: DAMN IT.

49
00:04:08,867 --> 00:04:10,747
Eugeo: THAT’S NOT LIKE YOU.

50
00:04:12,207 --> 00:04:13,837
Kirito: EUGEO?

51
00:04:13,837 --> 00:04:16,507
( Eugeo groans ) KIRITO.

52
00:04:16,507 --> 00:04:17,667
♪

53
00:04:26,057 --> 00:04:28,267
INTEGRITY KNIGHTS
AREN’T THE ONLY ONES

54
00:04:28,267 --> 00:04:29,477
WHO LOST THEIR MEMORIES.

55
00:04:29,477 --> 00:04:33,147
WE DID, TOO,
SOMETHING VERY IMPORTANT.

56
00:04:33,147 --> 00:04:35,897
YOU, ALICE, AND I
WERE BORN IN RULID

57
00:04:35,897 --> 00:04:38,857
AND GREW UP TOGETHER. REMEMBER?

58
00:04:38,857 --> 00:04:42,567
Kirito: YEAH.
I REMEMBER IT NOW.

59
00:04:42,567 --> 00:04:44,657
I WAS RIGHT THERE
WITH YOU IN THE SQUARE

60
00:04:44,657 --> 00:04:46,077
WHEN ALICE WAS TAKEN.

61
00:04:46,077 --> 00:04:50,617
Eugeo: I COULDN’T MOVE.
I FELT SO HELPLESS,

62
00:04:50,617 --> 00:04:53,377
BUT NOT YOU. YOU WERE SO BRAVE.

63
00:04:53,377 --> 00:04:55,537
YOU CHARGED IN
AND STOOD UP TO THAT KNIGHT.

64
00:04:55,537 --> 00:04:57,627
Kirito: EUGEO.

65
00:05:03,507 --> 00:05:05,467
Eugeo: THIS TIME,
I’M GOING TO HELP YOU,

66
00:05:05,467 --> 00:05:07,177
LIKE I SHOULD HAVE BACK THEN.

67
00:05:08,307 --> 00:05:11,307
THIS TIME, WE’LL SAVE ALICE.

68
00:05:11,307 --> 00:05:12,097
COME ON.

69
00:05:15,437 --> 00:05:16,647
KIRITO.

70
00:05:16,647 --> 00:05:18,857
ON YOUR FEET.

71
00:05:18,857 --> 00:05:21,487
YOU CAN DO IT. STAND UP...

72
00:05:21,487 --> 00:05:23,907
AS MANY TIMES AS IT TAKES.

73
00:05:27,827 --> 00:05:28,907
( Administrator winces )

74
00:05:28,907 --> 00:05:30,827
♪

75
00:05:42,927 --> 00:05:44,507
Eugeo: YOU CAN DO IT.

76
00:05:44,507 --> 00:05:46,297
GET UP...

77
00:05:46,297 --> 00:05:48,257
MY BEST FRIEND.

78
00:05:49,517 --> 00:05:50,307
MY...

79
00:05:51,477 --> 00:05:52,727
HERO.

80
00:05:54,647 --> 00:05:55,557
( Kirito gasps )

81
00:05:59,897 --> 00:06:01,567
YEAH. FOR YOU,

82
00:06:01,567 --> 00:06:04,527
I’LL STAND
AS MANY TIMES AS IT TAKES.

83
00:06:15,037 --> 00:06:18,127
Administrator:
HONESTLY, YOU HAVE LOST.

84
00:06:18,127 --> 00:06:20,247
WHY DO YOU CONTINUE TO RESIST?

85
00:06:23,007 --> 00:06:24,677
Kirito: ’CAUSE I CAN.

86
00:06:24,677 --> 00:06:26,717
IT’S WHY I’M STILL HERE,

87
00:06:26,717 --> 00:06:29,757
AND I WON’T STOP
’TIL YOU’RE GONE.

88
00:06:29,757 --> 00:06:31,677
Administrator:
THIS WORLD BELONGS TO ME.

89
00:06:31,677 --> 00:06:35,847
HOW DARE YOU COME HERE
UNINVITED AND DEFY MY RULE?

90
00:06:35,847 --> 00:06:37,807
ON YOUR KNEES!

91
00:06:37,807 --> 00:06:38,977
OFFER YOUR HEAD TO ME!

92
00:06:38,977 --> 00:06:41,317
ACCEPT YOUR DEFEAT!

93
00:06:47,487 --> 00:06:48,737
Kirito: NO WAY.

94
00:06:48,737 --> 00:06:51,787
YOU’RE NOT A RULER.
YOU’RE A THIEF.

95
00:06:51,787 --> 00:06:55,867
YOU DON’T LOVE THIS WORLD
OR THE PEOPLE WHO LIVE IN IT,

96
00:06:55,867 --> 00:06:58,577
SO YOU HAVE NO RIGHT
TO BE IN CHARGE!

97
00:07:02,127 --> 00:07:03,917
Administrator:
TO LOVE IS TO RULE,

98
00:07:03,917 --> 00:07:06,627
AND I LOVE EVERYTHING

99
00:07:06,627 --> 00:07:08,137
AND RULE EVERYTHING!

100
00:07:11,717 --> 00:07:13,677
( yells )

101
00:07:15,807 --> 00:07:17,347
( Kirito yells )

102
00:07:23,527 --> 00:07:25,027
( yells )

103
00:07:29,867 --> 00:07:30,817
( Administrator gasps )

104
00:07:30,817 --> 00:07:32,527
( growls )

105
00:07:32,527 --> 00:07:34,867
( Kirito yells )

106
00:07:36,907 --> 00:07:38,327
( woman vocalizing )

107
00:07:40,537 --> 00:07:42,167
Administrator: HOW DARE YOU?

108
00:07:44,497 --> 00:07:46,467
( growls )

109
00:07:46,467 --> 00:07:49,967
HOW DARE YOU?!

110
00:07:49,967 --> 00:07:51,257
( growls )

111
00:07:57,727 --> 00:07:59,347
( vocalizing stops )

112
00:08:00,727 --> 00:08:03,607
( Kirito yells )

113
00:08:09,777 --> 00:08:11,447
( gagging )

114
00:08:15,617 --> 00:08:16,447
( Administrator gags )

115
00:08:19,077 --> 00:08:24,377
CURSE YOU!

116
00:08:32,837 --> 00:08:33,927
Kirito: NOT YET.

117
00:08:35,927 --> 00:08:38,477
NOT YET!

118
00:08:39,807 --> 00:08:41,267
( yells )

119
00:08:45,067 --> 00:08:47,647
( yelling )

120
00:08:59,707 --> 00:09:01,497
( Administrator panting )

121
00:09:01,497 --> 00:09:03,287
♪

122
00:09:04,957 --> 00:09:06,037
IN THE END...

123
00:09:06,037 --> 00:09:09,797
NEITHER SWORD WAS METAL.

124
00:09:10,917 --> 00:09:12,927
( laughs )

125
00:09:12,927 --> 00:09:14,137
HOW FOOLISH.

126
00:09:14,137 --> 00:09:16,507
I DID NOT EXPECT THIS OUTCOME.

127
00:09:20,307 --> 00:09:24,347
EVEN IF I GATHERED UP
EVERY SPATIAL RESOURCE HERE,

128
00:09:24,347 --> 00:09:26,817
MY WOUND IS TOO GREAT TO HEAL.

129
00:09:26,817 --> 00:09:28,687
( laughs )

130
00:09:28,687 --> 00:09:32,487
AT THIS POINT,
I HAVE NO CHOICE.

131
00:09:34,197 --> 00:09:35,407
Kirito: WAIT. WHERE ARE YOU...

132
00:09:41,617 --> 00:09:42,997
( Administrator chuckles )

133
00:09:42,997 --> 00:09:45,287
( Kirito gasps )

134
00:09:45,287 --> 00:09:48,247
Administrator: IT IS
MUCH EARLIER THAN I HAD PLANNED.

135
00:09:48,247 --> 00:09:51,627
NEVERTHELESS,
IT IS TIME FOR ME TO GO.

136
00:10:00,217 --> 00:10:02,137
( chuckles )

137
00:10:02,137 --> 00:10:04,597
FAREWELL, LITTLE BOY,

138
00:10:04,597 --> 00:10:06,807
FOR NOW.

139
00:10:06,807 --> 00:10:08,437
THE NEXT TIME WE MEET...

140
00:10:09,817 --> 00:10:11,187
SHALL BE IN YOUR WORLD.

141
00:10:11,187 --> 00:10:14,817
Kirito: WHAT? NO!

142
00:10:14,817 --> 00:10:18,737
( no audible dialogue )

143
00:10:18,737 --> 00:10:21,237
Chudelkin: YOUR EMINENCE!

144
00:10:21,237 --> 00:10:24,867
DON’T LEAVE ME HERE!
TAKE ME WITH YOU!

145
00:10:24,867 --> 00:10:26,707
- ( Administrator gasps )
- ( Chudelkin laughing )

146
00:10:31,247 --> 00:10:32,757
- ( snarling )
- Administrator: LET GO,

147
00:10:32,757 --> 00:10:35,677
YOU CRETIN!
LET ME GO THIS INSTANT!

148
00:10:35,677 --> 00:10:37,387
Chudelkin: AT LAST.

149
00:10:37,387 --> 00:10:41,557
I CAN BECOME ONE
WITH YOU, YOUR EMINENCE.

150
00:10:41,557 --> 00:10:44,977
Administrator:
YOU DISGUSTING CLOWN!

151
00:10:44,977 --> 00:10:47,057
NO! NO!

152
00:10:47,057 --> 00:10:49,937
Chudelkin: MY ADMINISTRATOR!

153
00:10:49,937 --> 00:10:53,687
MY LADY.

154
00:10:53,687 --> 00:10:56,357
( Administrator gasps )

155
00:11:02,077 --> 00:11:03,747
( silence )

156
00:11:14,257 --> 00:11:15,467
Administrator: I DID LOVE IT.

157
00:11:17,297 --> 00:11:19,547
I LOVED ALL OF IT.

158
00:11:21,047 --> 00:11:22,967
( wind rushing )

159
00:11:27,137 --> 00:11:29,057
( Kirito panting )

160
00:11:33,277 --> 00:11:35,817
IT’S OVER.

161
00:11:35,817 --> 00:11:38,777
♪

162
00:11:38,777 --> 00:11:40,777
( gasping )

163
00:11:40,777 --> 00:11:41,867
EUGEO.

164
00:11:45,157 --> 00:11:46,827
( crystal cracks )

165
00:11:51,917 --> 00:11:53,997
PLEASE WORK.

166
00:11:53,997 --> 00:11:55,297
STOP BLEEDING!

167
00:11:55,297 --> 00:11:57,757
HEAL, GOD DAMN IT! COME ON!

168
00:11:57,757 --> 00:11:59,047
YOU CAN’T DIE!

169
00:11:59,047 --> 00:12:01,007
EUGEO!

170
00:12:05,927 --> 00:12:06,927
( gasps )

171
00:12:06,927 --> 00:12:09,387
Eugeo: STAY COOL...

172
00:12:09,387 --> 00:12:10,397
KIRITO.

173
00:12:10,397 --> 00:12:13,147
Kirito: EUGEO, LET GO.

174
00:12:13,147 --> 00:12:16,027
COME ON. I’M TRYIN’ TO HEAL YOU.

175
00:12:16,027 --> 00:12:17,687
Eugeo: DON’T BOTHER.

176
00:12:17,687 --> 00:12:20,107
IT’S FINE, REALLY.

177
00:12:20,107 --> 00:12:21,357
LEAVE IT.

178
00:12:21,357 --> 00:12:22,407
Kirito: WHAT ARE YOU SAYING?!

179
00:12:22,407 --> 00:12:23,907
I’M NOT GONNA LET YOU DIE!

180
00:12:23,907 --> 00:12:27,117
Eugeo: NO. THIS IS FOR THE BEST.

181
00:12:27,117 --> 00:12:29,367
IT HAS TO BE.

182
00:12:29,367 --> 00:12:32,247
OTHERWISE, YOU AND I,

183
00:12:32,247 --> 00:12:34,877
WE WOULD HAVE FOUGHT OVER ALICE,

184
00:12:34,877 --> 00:12:41,297
ME TO GET BACK THE MEMORY
OF THE ALICE I KNEW

185
00:12:41,297 --> 00:12:46,847
AND YOU TO SAVE
ALICE THE KNIGHT’S SOUL.

186
00:12:48,217 --> 00:12:49,347
Kirito: THEN GET UP, AND FIGHT!

187
00:12:49,347 --> 00:12:50,937
I’M GONNA HEAL YOU,

188
00:12:50,937 --> 00:12:53,057
AND THEN--THEN WE’LL FIGHT!

189
00:12:53,057 --> 00:12:55,647
YOU’RE WAY STRONGER THAN ME!
DO IT!

190
00:12:55,647 --> 00:12:58,737
DO IT FOR THE OLD ALICE’S SAKE!

191
00:12:58,737 --> 00:12:59,857
FIGHT ME!

192
00:12:59,857 --> 00:13:02,777
Eugeo: I CAN’T FIGHT...

193
00:13:02,777 --> 00:13:04,867
WITH A BROKEN SWORD.

194
00:13:04,867 --> 00:13:11,077
BESIDES, I WAS WEAK
AND GAVE IN TO ADMINISTRATOR.

195
00:13:11,077 --> 00:13:13,077
I TRIED TO KILL YOU.

196
00:13:13,077 --> 00:13:17,747
THIS IS HOW
I CAN PAY FOR THAT SIN.

197
00:13:17,747 --> 00:13:19,337
Kirito: LIKE I CARE!

198
00:13:19,337 --> 00:13:21,007
YOU WEREN’T
IN YOUR RIGHT MIND, ANYWAY!

199
00:13:21,007 --> 00:13:23,797
YOU FOUGHT BACK AND
SNAPPED YOURSELF OUT OF IT

200
00:13:23,797 --> 00:13:25,297
LIKE THE BADASS YOU ARE.

201
00:13:25,297 --> 00:13:26,887
IF IT WASN’T FOR YOU,

202
00:13:26,887 --> 00:13:28,927
WE COULDN’T HAVE
BEAT ADMINISTRATOR,

203
00:13:28,927 --> 00:13:31,137
SO YOU GOT NOTHING
TO FEEL GUILTY ABOUT.

204
00:13:31,137 --> 00:13:32,767
YOU GOT NOTHING TO PAY FOR!

205
00:13:32,767 --> 00:13:35,397
Eugeo: I WISH...

206
00:13:35,397 --> 00:13:37,227
THAT WERE TRUE.

207
00:13:37,227 --> 00:13:40,107
I ALWAYS...

208
00:13:40,107 --> 00:13:43,527
WISHED I COULD BE
MORE LIKE YOU.

209
00:13:45,277 --> 00:13:50,327
YOU’RE SO BRAVE,
AND EVERYONE LOVES YOU.

210
00:13:50,327 --> 00:13:53,537
I BET ALICE DOES, TOO.

211
00:13:55,127 --> 00:13:57,127
NOW I KNOW...

212
00:13:57,127 --> 00:14:00,507
LOVE ISN’T SOMETHING YOU GET.

213
00:14:00,507 --> 00:14:03,427
IT’S SOMETHING YOU GIVE.

214
00:14:03,427 --> 00:14:06,337
ALICE TAUGHT ME THAT.

215
00:14:09,007 --> 00:14:11,677
♪

216
00:14:11,677 --> 00:14:13,597
Alice: I DON’T SEE YOU WORKING.

217
00:14:13,597 --> 00:14:16,897
LOOK. I’M ALMOST DONE
MAKING MY PART OF IT.

218
00:14:16,897 --> 00:14:18,227
HOW FAR DID YOU GET?

219
00:14:18,227 --> 00:14:21,567
Kirito: I’M WAY
FURTHER ALONG THAN YOU.

220
00:14:21,567 --> 00:14:23,187
THE GUARD’S ALL THAT’S LEFT.

221
00:14:23,187 --> 00:14:24,697
Alice: THEN, LET’S STAY HERE

222
00:14:24,697 --> 00:14:27,197
AND KEEP WORKING
UNTIL WE FINISH IT.

223
00:14:27,197 --> 00:14:28,987
Kirito: MM-HMM. BUT, LIKE,

224
00:14:28,987 --> 00:14:31,327
WHAT IF HE COMES LOOKIN’?
LET’S GO BACK.

225
00:14:31,327 --> 00:14:32,997
Alice: BUT WE’RE
ALMOST FINISHED.

226
00:14:32,997 --> 00:14:36,417
LET’S STAY.
JUST A BIT LONGER, PLEASE?

227
00:14:36,417 --> 00:14:38,537
Kirito: HMM. OKAY.

228
00:14:38,537 --> 00:14:41,127
YOU WIN, BUT WE SHOULD
STILL HURRY IT UP.

229
00:14:41,127 --> 00:14:41,917
Alice: MM-HMM!

230
00:14:45,007 --> 00:14:46,257
ALL DONE!

231
00:14:46,257 --> 00:14:47,297
Kirito: SO AM I!

232
00:14:47,297 --> 00:14:48,887
WAIT.

233
00:14:48,887 --> 00:14:51,097
YOU’VE BEEN HERE
THIS WHOLE TIME?

234
00:14:53,217 --> 00:14:54,387
Eugeo: WHAT YOU TWO DOING?

235
00:14:54,387 --> 00:14:56,847
Kirito: UM, NOTHING.

236
00:14:56,847 --> 00:14:59,057
( both stammer )

237
00:14:59,057 --> 00:15:00,357
( Kirito gasps )

238
00:15:00,357 --> 00:15:03,147
Alice:
IT’S THREE DAYS TOO EARLY,

239
00:15:03,147 --> 00:15:05,197
BUT, OH, WELL.

240
00:15:05,197 --> 00:15:07,237
HAPPY BIRTHDAY, EUGEO!

241
00:15:07,237 --> 00:15:08,617
( giggles )

242
00:15:09,947 --> 00:15:12,987
Eugeo: IS--IS THAT FOR ME?

243
00:15:12,987 --> 00:15:14,947
Kirito: IT’S NO MATCH
FOR THE REAL THING,

244
00:15:14,947 --> 00:15:17,497
LIKE THE ONE
YOUR BIG BROTHER’S GOT.

245
00:15:17,497 --> 00:15:20,167
STILL, THIS ONE’S BETTER

246
00:15:20,167 --> 00:15:22,547
THAN ANY OF THE WOODEN SWORDS
THE SHOP IN TOWN CARRIES.

247
00:15:22,547 --> 00:15:24,127
( chuckles )

248
00:15:24,127 --> 00:15:25,377
- ( giggles )

249
00:15:25,377 --> 00:15:28,087
(Eugeo gasps )

250
00:15:32,467 --> 00:15:34,347
IT’S WONDERFUL.

251
00:15:34,347 --> 00:15:36,887
I-IT’S BEAUTIFUL.

252
00:15:36,887 --> 00:15:39,057
I’LL TAKE GOOD CARE OF IT!

253
00:15:39,057 --> 00:15:40,607
THANK YOU BOTH.

254
00:15:40,607 --> 00:15:44,147
I NEVER GOT A BIRTHDAY GIFT
THAT MADE ME SO--SO HAPPY.

255
00:15:44,147 --> 00:15:46,187
Kirito: UH, WHAT ARE
YOU CRYIN’ FOR?!

256
00:15:46,187 --> 00:15:47,237
Eugeo: EH?

257
00:15:47,237 --> 00:15:48,607
I WASN’T!

258
00:15:48,607 --> 00:15:49,527
SEE?

259
00:15:51,237 --> 00:15:52,487
Kirito: HMM.

260
00:15:53,577 --> 00:15:55,287
( Alice sighs )

261
00:15:55,287 --> 00:15:56,287
( chuckles )

262
00:15:57,577 --> 00:15:58,827
( Kirito gasps )

263
00:16:00,377 --> 00:16:03,287
WAIT!

264
00:16:03,287 --> 00:16:07,417
Eugeo: US THREE GREW UP TOGETHER
AND WERE THE BEST OF FRIENDS.

265
00:16:07,417 --> 00:16:09,427
Alice: WE’RE GOING
DIFFERENT WAYS NOW,

266
00:16:09,427 --> 00:16:11,757
BUT OUR MEMORIES
WILL LIVE FOREVER.

267
00:16:11,757 --> 00:16:15,467
Both: WE’LL BE WITH YOU FOREVER.

268
00:16:15,467 --> 00:16:17,557
YOU SEE? IT’S FINE.

269
00:16:17,557 --> 00:16:19,767
( singing in Japanese )

270
00:16:19,767 --> 00:16:23,187
Eugeo: YOU SEE? IT’S FINE.

271
00:16:23,187 --> 00:16:25,647
SO DON’T CRY, KIRITO.

272
00:16:25,647 --> 00:16:27,237
Kirito: I WON’T.

273
00:16:27,237 --> 00:16:29,697
LIKE YOU SAID, YOU’RE NOT GONE.

274
00:16:29,697 --> 00:16:31,947
YOU’LL BE HERE FOREVER.

275
00:16:31,947 --> 00:16:35,117
Eugeo: FOREVER AND EVER,
THE BEST OF...

276
00:16:35,117 --> 00:16:37,247
- ( Kirito gasping )
- Eugeo: FRIENDS.

277
00:16:39,327 --> 00:16:40,327
KIRITO...

278
00:16:40,327 --> 00:16:42,037
YOU THERE?

279
00:16:42,037 --> 00:16:43,377
WHERE’D YOU GO?

280
00:16:45,167 --> 00:16:46,547
Kirito: I’M HERE.

281
00:16:46,547 --> 00:16:48,257
I’M RIGHT HERE.

282
00:16:48,257 --> 00:16:52,547
Eugeo: OH, I SEE NOW.

283
00:16:52,547 --> 00:16:56,007
STARS SPARKLING IN THE DARK.

284
00:16:56,007 --> 00:17:00,637
THE NIGHT SKY
ABOVE THE GIGAS CEDAR

285
00:17:00,637 --> 00:17:03,517
WAS FULL OF STARS.

286
00:17:03,517 --> 00:17:08,527
YOUR SWORD SPARKLES LIKE THAT.

287
00:17:08,527 --> 00:17:12,357
HEY, HOW’S THAT FOR A NAME?

288
00:17:12,357 --> 00:17:15,657
CALL IT THE NIGHT SKY BLADE.

289
00:17:15,657 --> 00:17:18,237
Kirito: YEAH. THAT’S A GOOD ONE.

290
00:17:18,237 --> 00:17:20,747
THANK YOU, EUGEO.

291
00:17:20,747 --> 00:17:24,077
Eugeo: YOU’RE LIKE
THE NIGHT SKY,

292
00:17:24,077 --> 00:17:26,497
WRAPPING THIS SORRY WORLD

293
00:17:26,497 --> 00:17:29,627
IN YOUR STARS.

294
00:17:30,717 --> 00:17:32,627
♪

295
00:17:48,397 --> 00:17:50,567
Eugeo: I GUESS THIS IS
FOR THE BEST, HUH?

296
00:17:50,567 --> 00:17:52,067
Young Alice: IT IS.

297
00:17:52,067 --> 00:17:54,487
WE CAN LEAVE THE REST
TO THOSE TWO NOW.

298
00:17:54,487 --> 00:17:57,577
I’M SURE THEY’LL GUIDE THE WORLD
IN THE RIGHT DIRECTION.

299
00:17:57,577 --> 00:18:00,747
Eugeo: OKAY.
WELL, THEN? YOU READY?

300
00:18:00,747 --> 00:18:02,747
Alice: YES.

301
00:18:02,747 --> 00:18:04,667
♪

302
00:18:39,197 --> 00:18:41,407
♪

303
00:18:47,497 --> 00:18:49,337
( Kirito gasps )

304
00:19:04,307 --> 00:19:05,307
KIKUOKA!

305
00:19:05,307 --> 00:19:07,307
KIKUOKA, PICK UP!

306
00:19:07,307 --> 00:19:09,437
( groans )

307
00:19:09,437 --> 00:19:12,187
KIKUOKA!

308
00:19:12,187 --> 00:19:14,437
- ( transmission crackles )
- ( gasps )

309
00:19:14,437 --> 00:19:16,607
( gunfire )

310
00:19:16,607 --> 00:19:18,407
Nakanishi: LIEUTENANT COLONEL,

311
00:19:18,407 --> 00:19:20,777
THE DOOR’S BEEN BREACHED!
WE HAVE TO LEAVE!

312
00:19:20,777 --> 00:19:23,157
THEY’LL BE
IN THE CONTROL ROOM ANY SECOND!

313
00:19:23,157 --> 00:19:24,827
I’M SHUTTING THE BULKHEAD.

314
00:19:24,827 --> 00:19:27,497
Kikuoka: NO, WAIT!
JUST GIVE ME A COUPLE MINUTES.

315
00:19:27,497 --> 00:19:29,747
I HAVE TO SORT
A FEW THINGS OUT HERE.

316
00:19:29,747 --> 00:19:32,797
- ( gunfire continues )
- Kirito: WHAT THE...

317
00:19:32,797 --> 00:19:35,587
Kikuoka: HIGA, HOW LONG
’TIL WE’RE LOCKED DOWN?

318
00:19:35,587 --> 00:19:38,507
Higa: I NEED ANOTHER 80--
NO, 70 SECONDS!

319
00:19:38,507 --> 00:19:40,717
WH--HOLY CRAP!

320
00:19:40,717 --> 00:19:43,597
HEY, KEEKS, IT’S A CALL
FROM THE UNDERWORLD.

321
00:19:43,597 --> 00:19:44,517
IT’S...

322
00:19:46,017 --> 00:19:48,727
DUDE, IT’S HIM! IT’S KIRIGAYA!

323
00:19:48,727 --> 00:19:50,437
Kikuoka: WH--REALLY?!

324
00:19:50,437 --> 00:19:51,807
- KIRITO!
- ( Kirito gasps )

325
00:19:51,807 --> 00:19:52,727
( gunfire )

326
00:20:02,907 --> 00:20:05,407
Kikuoka: COME IN, KIRITO!
ARE YOU THERE?!

327
00:20:05,407 --> 00:20:06,867
Kirito: YEAH, I’M HERE.

328
00:20:06,867 --> 00:20:08,367
YOU KNOW WHAT YOU’VE DONE?!

329
00:20:08,367 --> 00:20:10,457
HUH?! YOU SON OF A BITCH!

330
00:20:10,457 --> 00:20:12,787
Kikuoka: CAN WE PLEASE
SAVE THE INSULTS FOR LATER?

331
00:20:12,787 --> 00:20:15,167
RIGHT NOW, I NEED YOU
TO LISTEN TO ME.

332
00:20:15,167 --> 00:20:16,917
- Kirito: WHAT?!
- ( gunfire )

333
00:20:16,917 --> 00:20:18,927
I HEAR SHOOTING!
WHAT’S GOING ON?!

334
00:20:31,057 --> 00:20:33,437
Kikuoka: I CAN’T
GET INTO THAT RIGHT NOW.

335
00:20:33,437 --> 00:20:36,357
LISTEN, KIRITO. I NEED YOU
TO LOCATE A GIRL NAMED ALICE.

336
00:20:36,357 --> 00:20:37,647
FIND HER, AND TAKE HER TO--

337
00:20:37,647 --> 00:20:39,277
Kirito: I DON’T
HAVE TO LOOK FOR HER.

338
00:20:39,277 --> 00:20:41,067
- SHE’S RIGHT HERE!
- Kikuoka: YOU HAVE HER?

339
00:20:41,067 --> 00:20:44,027
Higa: YOU GOTTA BE KIDDING.
THAT KID’S AWESOME!

340
00:20:44,027 --> 00:20:46,577
Kikuoka: YEAH. ALL RIGHT,
ONCE WE’RE OFF THE LINE,

341
00:20:46,577 --> 00:20:48,497
I’LL CRANK THE F.L.A. TO 1,000.

342
00:20:48,497 --> 00:20:51,417
THEN, TAKE ALICE AND HEAD
TO THE WORLD’S END ALTAR!

343
00:20:51,417 --> 00:20:53,537
Kirito: I NEVER HEARD
OF THAT PLACE!

344
00:20:53,537 --> 00:20:55,667
Kikuoka: THAT’S OKAY!
JUST GO OUT THE EASTERN GATE,

345
00:20:55,667 --> 00:20:56,957
AND THE ALTAR’S DUE SOUTH!

346
00:20:56,957 --> 00:20:58,707
- Nakanishi: UH, SIR!
- ( Kikuoka gasps )

347
00:21:00,547 --> 00:21:02,547
Nakanishi: TWO OF THEM
ARE HEADING DOWN THE CORRIDOR,

348
00:21:02,547 --> 00:21:04,047
- TOWARD ELECTRIC!
- Kikuoka: WHAT?!

349
00:21:07,717 --> 00:21:10,557
Intruder: BE CAREFUL.
WE JUST NEED THE MAINS OFF.

350
00:21:10,557 --> 00:21:12,767
WHATEVER YOU DO,
DON’T DAMAGE THE LINES

351
00:21:12,767 --> 00:21:14,227
FOR THE LIGHT CUBE CLUSTER.

352
00:21:14,227 --> 00:21:15,727
Intruder 2:
WOULD YOU RELAX, BRO?

353
00:21:15,727 --> 00:21:17,017
I KNOW WHAT TO CUT.

354
00:21:17,017 --> 00:21:18,897
Higa: WE’RE SCREWED!
WHAT DO WE DO?!

355
00:21:18,897 --> 00:21:21,607
IF THEY CUT
THE MAIN POWER LINE NOW,

356
00:21:21,607 --> 00:21:23,657
IT’S GONNA CAUSE A SURGE!

357
00:21:23,657 --> 00:21:25,867
LIGHT CUBE CLUSTERS
SHOULD BE SAFE,

358
00:21:25,867 --> 00:21:29,577
BUT THE SUBCOMPUTER WHERE
KIRIGAYA’S S.T.L. IS WON’T BE!

359
00:21:29,577 --> 00:21:32,037
THE SURGE’LL COOK
HIS FLUCTLIGHT!

360
00:21:32,037 --> 00:21:35,957
( Kikuoka gasps ) O-OKAY,
I’LL HANDLE THE LOCKDOWN.

361
00:21:35,957 --> 00:21:39,667
HIGA, TAKE DR. KOJIRO AND ASUNA
AND GET TO THE UPPER SHAFT!

362
00:21:39,667 --> 00:21:40,877
KEEP KIRITO SAFE.

363
00:21:40,877 --> 00:21:42,427
Kirito: ASUNA?

364
00:21:42,427 --> 00:21:44,337
WHAT THE HELL?

365
00:21:44,337 --> 00:21:47,137
WHAT’S SHE DOING AT RATH?

366
00:21:47,137 --> 00:21:48,507
Security:
THEY’RE CUTTING THE POWER!

367
00:21:48,507 --> 00:21:50,057
THE SCREW PROPELLERS
ARE GOING DOWN!

368
00:21:54,597 --> 00:21:57,317
( tone blares )

369
00:21:57,317 --> 00:21:59,817
( crackling )

370
00:22:01,687 --> 00:22:05,777
Asuna: KIRITO. KIRITO!

371
00:22:05,777 --> 00:22:06,947
Kirito: ASUNA.

372
00:22:06,947 --> 00:22:10,827
( crackling )

373
00:22:10,827 --> 00:22:14,537
Singer: ♪ OH, EVERYTHING
TURNS TO ASH, TO ASH ♪

374
00:22:14,537 --> 00:22:16,207
( singing in Japanese )

375
00:22:23,967 --> 00:22:27,427
♪ AND EVERYTHING
TURNS TO DUST, TO DUST ♪

376
00:22:27,427 --> 00:22:29,097
( singing in Japanese )

377
00:22:36,847 --> 00:22:38,807
♪ FORGET-ME-NOT ♪

